From 7ff6769cf63e27ffc07ec231fa5d5d9eaa74287d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Minkovsky <dminkovsky@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 11:03:37 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Read the upcoming queue as a list of range windows with its
 own count

The context lane's places are dense integers, so a place is the key the
lists infrastructure needs. The upcoming tracks become one more list: windows
bounded by keys, a count of their own, the position of a key and the key at a
position, in the lane's own order or the shuffled one.

